      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Searcy%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Harding University, a private Christian university founded in 1924, sits on Searcy’s main campus and gives the city a college‑town vibe.",
